                <note rend="inline" type="source">125.313/11–1949: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Vice Consul at Chungking</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Rozier</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Chungking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-11-19">November 19, 1949.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received November 19—6:43 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Consulate and radio closed. Last despatch number 62 [<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >66</hi>], last telegram number 246.<anchor n="70" xml:id="d1694-f1"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rozier</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
